{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人必重归故土"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华必怜悯雅各，再次拣选以色列人，把他们安置在他们自己的土地上。外族人必与他们联合，归入雅各家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["列邦必带他们重返故乡。在耶和华赐给他们的土地上，外族人必做他们的仆婢。他们必掳掠以前掳掠他们的人，统治以前压迫他们的人。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["对巴比伦的讽刺"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华使他们脱离痛苦、悲伤和残酷奴役的时候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他们必这样讥笑巴比伦王：",{"text":"“暴君灭亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴政结束了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华折断了邪恶之人的棍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折断了掌权者的杖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们曾狂怒地攻伐列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无休无止，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带着怒气征服列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大肆迫害。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今天下太平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人欢呼歌唱，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松树和黎巴嫩的香柏树都因你而欢喜，说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘自从你灭亡后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再没有人上来砍伐我们。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你下到阴间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"阴间骚动，迎接你的到来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在世上做过首领的阴魂都起身欢迎你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国的先王都从座位上站起来迎候你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都对你说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘你如今也跟我们一样软弱无能！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你和我们一样了！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的荣华和琴声一同坠入阴间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虫成了你的床铺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛆成了你的被子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"“明亮的晨星，黎明之子啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎么从天上坠落下来？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这打败列国的怎么被砍倒在地上？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾想，‘我要升到天上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我的宝座高高地设立在上帝的众星之上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要坐在遥远的北方众神明聚会的山上；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要升到云天之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使自己与至高者一样。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你必坠入阴间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掉进死亡的深坑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看见你的都定睛审视你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心想，‘这就是那曾使大地震动、列国颤抖的人吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这就是那曾使天下荒凉、城邑倾覆、不肯释放俘虏回家的人吗？’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国的君王都躺在自己华丽的陵墓中，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有你像一根毫无用处的树枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被抛弃在自己的坟墓外。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就像一具遭人践踏的尸体，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与丧身刀下的人一同被扔进乱石坑里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必得不到君王的葬礼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你毁坏国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杀害自己的百姓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“恶人的子孙必永远被遗忘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的祖先罪恶深重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"预备杀戮他的子孙吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得他们兴起统治世界、到处建造城邑。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我必起来攻击巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铲除巴比伦的名号、余民和子孙后代。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必用毁灭的扫帚清扫它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它成为沼泽之地和刺猬的住所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是万军之耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["关于亚述的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我所定的计划必实现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所定的旨意必成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我的土地上击垮亚述人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的山上践踏他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除去他们加在我子民身上的轭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪去他们肩头的重担。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是我对全世界所定的计划，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是向列国伸出的惩罚之手。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华定了计划，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能阻挠呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的手已经伸出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能叫祂收回呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["关于非利士的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"亚哈斯王驾崩那年，我得到以下预言：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要因击打你们的杖已经折断","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"便高兴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为从那条蛇必生出一条更危险的蛇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一条会飞的毒蛇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贫穷人必衣食无忧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"困苦人必安然度日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我必用饥荒除掉你们的根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杀死你们残存的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城门啊，哀号吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑啊，哭喊吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人啊，你们都战栗吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为军队从北方如尘烟滚滚而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们阵容整齐，无人掉队。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"该怎样回复外国的使者呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要告诉他们：“耶和华建立了锡安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂困苦的子民必在其中得到保护。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"“击打你们的杖已经折断”指攻击非利士的王已死。","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":29}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}